#: patterns/page-faq.php:18
msgid ""
"Spreadsheets (.xlsx) open in Microsoft Excel, Google Sheets (free) and "
"LibreOffice Calc (free). Documents (.docx) open in Microsoft Word, Google "
"Docs and LibreOffice Writer. Printables (.pdf) open in any PDF reader. Each "
"product page lists its exact files."
