#: patterns/page-faq.php:19
msgid "Can I use the files on my phone?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/page-faq.php:19
msgid ""
"You can view and make small edits with the Google Sheets, Google Docs or "
"Microsoft apps on a phone. For setting things up the first time, a computer "
"or tablet is more comfortable."
